"Credits","kind":"page","href":"/credits","sub":"The authors we install"},{"label":"Getting help","kind":"page","href":"/support","sub":"Where to take a problem"},{"label":"Supporting Mereth","kind":"page","href":"/donate","sub":"How the server is funded"},{"label":"Mining","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Mining","sub":"extracts ore, gems and minerals","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Fishing","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Fishing","sub":"catches fish","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Saltmaking","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Saltmaking","sub":"harvests sea salt deposits and grinds salt at grain mills","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Hunting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Hunting","sub":"harvests pelts and meat from wild animals","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Herbalism","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Herbalism","sub":"gathers herbs, mushrooms and berries","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Woodcutting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Woodcutting","sub":"chops firewood and burns charcoal at the kiln","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Beekeeping","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Beekeeping","sub":"catch wild bees, tend hives, and gather honeycomb (tiered by hive type)","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Farming","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Farming","sub":"grows and harvests crops, keeps chickens and cattle","terms":"Gathering"},{"label":"Lockpicking","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Lockpicking","sub":"opens locks with picks","terms":"Movement & stealth"},{"label":"Pickpocketing","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Pickpocketing","sub":"requires this skill on your locked plan (screen will not open without it). Uses vanilla pickpocket chance; grants Light Fingers and related perks by tier. Works on NPCs and players.","terms":"Movement & stealth"},{"label":"Sneaking","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Sneaking","sub":"earn XP while moving (on foot), sneaking undetected, with hostiles nearby. Grants vanilla Sneak Stealth perks by tier.","terms":"Movement & stealth"},{"label":"Sprinting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Sprinting","sub":"earn XP while sprinting on foot (not mounted). After Lock In, higher level increases sprint speed and stamina recovery while sprinting; higher memory tier adds extra bonuses.","terms":"Movement & stealth"},{"label":"Smelting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Smelting","sub":"refines ore into ingots at kilns and smelters","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Armorsmithing","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Armorsmithing","sub":"crafts metal armor","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Weaponsmithing","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Weaponsmithing","sub":"crafts metal weapons","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Jewelcrafting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Jewelcrafting","sub":"crafts jewellery","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Leatherworking","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Leatherworking","sub":"works leather and makes leather goods","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Tailoring","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Tailoring","sub":"sews various clothing","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Carpentry","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Carpentry","sub":"makes wooden items, bows, arrows, bolts and crossbows","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Brewing","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Brewing","sub":"brews mead and makes wine","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Cooking","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Cooking","sub":"prepares food","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Animal Taming","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Animal%20Taming","sub":"anyone can Pet (E) or Feed (F), but only a Lock In tamer builds trust on wild animals. Feed the right fruit by tier until they bond. Keep trust up with Pet/Feed or they run free (offline too). Give (G) a companion to another player so they can care for it. One companion each. Horses use Horse Riding to mount.","terms":"Crafting & trades"},{"label":"Horse Riding","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Horse%20Riding","sub":"assign and Lock In to mount horses. Plan tier sets which mounts you can use (common horses T1, Frost T3, Arvak / unicorn T4, Shadowmere T5). Level and tier improve mount speed and stamina recovery while riding. Earn XP while mounted and moving.","terms":"Movement & stealth"},{"label":"Daggers","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Daggers","sub":"Daggers: vanilla WeapTypeDagger.","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Maces","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Maces","sub":"Maces: clubs, maces, and one-handed blunt weapons (WeapTypeMace / Club).","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Swords","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Swords","sub":"Swords: one-handed blades (WeapTypeSword; shortswords and similar map here).","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"War Axes","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=War%20Axes","sub":"War axes: one-handed axes (WeapTypeWarAxe).","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Battleaxes","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Battleaxes","sub":"Battleaxes: two-handed axes (WeapTypeBattleaxe).","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Greatswords","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Greatswords","sub":"Greatswords: two-handed swords (WeapTypeGreatsword).","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Warhammers","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Warhammers","sub":"Warhammers: two-handed hammers (WeapTypeWarhammer; battle staves map here).","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Bows","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Bows","sub":"Bows: WeapTypeBow.","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Crossbows","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Crossbows","sub":"Crossbows: WeapTypeCrossbow.","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Unarmed","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Unarmed","sub":"Unarmed: bare-hand fighting (no weapon equipped). Scales punch damage like other weapon specializations; pair with One-Handed for stamina and vanilla fist perks.","terms":"Weapon Specializations"},{"label":"Spellcasting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Spellcasting","sub":"foundation of all magic. Without it on your plan, spells have no combat effect; with it, your magicka pool grows with level, and each plan tier adds a larger reserve. Spell costs stay as written: the engine spends magicka normally.","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Light Armor","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Light%20Armor","sub":"Infantry specialised in light armor and mobility.","terms":"Armor Specializations"},{"label":"Heavy Armor","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Heavy%20Armor","sub":"Man-at-arms specialised in heavy armor and protection.","terms":"Armor Specializations"},{"label":"Block","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Block","sub":"vanilla Skyrim Block skill: Shield Wall perks and required for mitigating blocked hits (with skill damage formula). Trains on any successful block. While using a shield you must also have the matching Light or Heavy Shield skill on your plan or that shield will not mitigate damage.","terms":"Armor Specializations"},{"label":"Light Shield","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Light%20Shield","sub":"required on your plan to mitigate blocks with a light shield (Hide, Elven, Glass, Dragonscale, Imperial Light, and mod light variants). Material tier must match your skill progress, same as Light Armor. Scales with Block.","terms":"Armor Specializations"},{"label":"Heavy Shield","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Heavy%20Shield","sub":"required on your plan to mitigate blocks with a heavy shield (Iron, Steel, Dwarven, and other heavy materials / mod heavy variants). Material tier must match your skill progress, same as Heavy Armor. Scales with Block.","terms":"Armor Specializations"},{"label":"Alchemy","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Alchemy","sub":"Alchemist: brews potions, mixes dyes and applies healing poultices","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Conjuration","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Conjuration","sub":"Conjurer: practises the school of Conjuration","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Enchanting","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Enchanting","sub":"Enchanter: applies enchantments to various items","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Alteration","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Alteration","sub":"Mystic: practises the school of Alteration","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Destruction","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Destruction","sub":"Spellcaster: practises the school of Destruction","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Illusion","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Illusion","sub":"Illusionist: practises the school of Illusion","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"Restoration","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Restoration","sub":"Healer: practises the school of Restoration","terms":"Magic schools"},{"label":"One-Handed","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=One-Handed","sub":"vanilla Armsman and one-handed perks by memory tier. Unlocks and scales with level; improves stamina efficiency on one-handed swings. Pair with a weapon specialization (daggers, swords, unarmed, etc.) for damage and weapon access.","terms":"Combat styles"},{"label":"Two-Handed","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Two-Handed","sub":"vanilla Barbarian and two-handed perks by memory tier. Unlocks and scales with level; improves stamina efficiency on two-handed swings. Pair with a weapon specialization (greatsword, battleaxe, warhammer) for damage and weapon access.","terms":"Combat styles"},{"label":"Dual Wield","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Dual%20Wield","sub":"Dual Flurry and Dual Savagery by tier (requires two one-handed weapons). Unlocks and scales with level; improves stamina efficiency while dual wielding. Weapon specializations still set damage per weapon type.","terms":"Combat styles"},{"label":"Archery","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Archery","sub":"vanilla Overdraw and bow perks by memory tier (bows and crossbows). Unlocks and scales with level; improves stamina efficiency when drawing and holding. Pair with Bows / Crossbows specializations for damage and weapon access.","terms":"Combat styles"},{"label":"Musicianship","kind":"skill","href":"/skills#all&q=Musicianship","sub":"perform bard songs for the room. Open the Perform menu (F5) with a lute, flute, or drum in your bag to play instrumentals and requestable vocal ballads. Mute sound + Keep playing lets you perform over voice chat without the idle cutting out between loops. Finishing a song pays its XP plus a crowd bonus per listener in earshot (1 for early songs, 2 for tier 3+ ballads); playing to an empty room pays nothing. Higher tier unlocks longer, more demanding songs (Ragnar the Red, Age of Aggression/Oppression, The Dragonborn Comes, Tale of the Tongues). Nearby players hear you in 3D.","terms":"Performance"},{"label":"What is Mereth?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#first","sub":"Before you apply"},{"label":"Who is it for?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#first","sub":"Before you apply"},{"label":"What do I need to own and install?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#first","sub":"Before you apply"},{"label":"How do I log in?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#first","sub":"Before you apply"},{"label":"Is AI-written roleplay allowed?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#first","sub":"Before you apply"},{"label":"When is this set?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#setting","sub":"Setting and lore"},{"label":"What is the situation?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#setting","sub":"Setting and lore"},{"label":"Can I play a character from Elder Scrolls lore?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#setting","sub":"Setting and lore"},{"label":"Why does everyone say magic feels different here?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#setting","sub":"Setting and lore"},{"label":"Which races can I play?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#setting","sub":"Setting and lore"},{"label":"When does the civil war start?","kind":"answer","href":"/faq#setting","sub":"Setting and lore"},{"label":"How does the