cter","kind":"section","href":"/progression#shape","sub":"Progression"},{"label":"What eighteen points actually buys","kind":"section","href":"/progression#budget","sub":"Progression"},{"label":"What to expect at each tier","kind":"section","href":"/progression#expect","sub":"Progression"},{"label":"Weapons, and why there is no table","kind":"section","href":"/progression#foic","sub":"Progression"},{"label":"How experience actually accrues","kind":"section","href":"/progression#earning","sub":"Progression"},{"label":"Magic advances differently","kind":"section","href":"/progression#magic","sub":"Progression"},{"label":"The bars at a glance","kind":"section","href":"/survival#bars","sub":"Food, Drink and Energy"},{"label":"Where the thresholds sit","kind":"section","href":"/survival#thresholds","sub":"Food, Drink and Energy"},{"label":"The purple bar, explained properly","kind":"section","href":"/survival#exhaustion","sub":"Food, Drink and Energy"},{"label":"Buffs worth planning around","kind":"section","href":"/survival#buffs","sub":"Food, Drink and Energy"},{"label":"When it goes wrong","kind":"section","href":"/survival#hurt","sub":"Food, Drink and Energy"},{"label":"The Companions","kind":"section","href":"/lore/companions","sub":"The hall at Whiterun, and the mantle nobody has claimed for forty years.","terms":"The fields of Whiterun, the heart of the Fatherland, have for millennia been home to the storied Hall of Jorrvaskr and the valiant Nord Companions. From the days of Ysgramor, the Companions have ever held the honor of all Nords and the growing realm of Skyrim in their words and deeds, unyielding in valor and strength; however, darkness has fallen upon the Meadhall of the Hoary King, and mirth ring"},{"label":"The Harbinger’s Reflections on the Decline of the Guild","kind":"section","href":"/lore/harbinger-reflections","sub":"A Harbinger writing on how the Companions declined.","terms":"To Jorm, trusted shield brother Brother, I see clearly the path we are walking. Many speak of strength as if it were an absolute virtue. Yet the history of the North is filled with peoples who were strong… and nonetheless vanished. The Snow Elves did not fall only beneath the axes of our ancestors. They fell because something within them broke long before their walls did. When a people lose their "},{"label":"Letter from Yjorn Gray-Mane, Custodian of the Skyforge","kind":"section","href":"/lore/greymane-skyforge-letter","sub":"The custodian of the Skyforge, on why his hammer is still.","terms":"To the Companions of Jorrvaskr, or whoever finds this letter I write these words in the shadow of silence, far from prying eyes and listening ears, for what I must say weighs upon my heart like an anvil upon the chest."},{"label":"Letters of a Shield Brother in Times of Turmoil","kind":"section","href":"/lore/shield-brother-letters","sub":"Letters between shield brothers during the turmoil.","terms":"Brother, tonight I drank with the others in the long hall. The laughter was loud, the cups full, the stories greater than usual. And yet, beneath that noise, I felt the pulse of something older. Not the drum of war. Not the song of heroes. But the call of the hunt. Primal instincts passed down by our ancestors. When I look into the fire, I do not see a gift. I see a promise made too quickly. They "},{"label":"The College of Winterhold","kind":"section","href":"/lore/college-winterhold","sub":"The College, its semesters, and what it asks of applicants.","terms":"Skyrim is a land renowned for its frozen peaks and harsh storms, but one cannot truly appreciate what it means to be of this land until they have weathered the jagged shores battered by the Sea of Ghosts. Glaciers drift in the frozen fog as massive ice sheets pretend at being land - until they crack upon and plunge the unwary wanderer into a fathomless frozen sea. It is upon these shores that myth"},{"label":"The Thieves' Guild","kind":"section","href":"/lore/thieves-guild","sub":"What the Guild is in Skyrim, told plainly.","terms":"To outlanders, Skyrim is a land of harsh storms, enduring traditions, strong warriors, and honorable - if brutal - cultural inheritance. The Nords are equally hardy, sons and daughters of storm and sky, and none would imagine first among Nords the ways of stealth or subterfuge; regardless, where there is light, there must be shadow. Where there is law, there must be crime, and not all criminals of"},{"label":"Atmoran Clevercraft","kind":"section","href":"/lore/atmoran-clevercraft","sub":"Clevercraft, and what Shalidor left behind.","terms":"The Secrets of Shalidor’s Legacy By Laah’dan of Atmora"},{"label":"On The Learnings of Bron Laah’dan","kind":"section","href":"/lore/bron-laahdan-treatise","sub":"A treatise dictated by a master, on the learnings of Bron Laah'dan.","terms":"A Scholarly Treatise Dictated by Master of Alteration Halgaar Frost-Fingers"},{"label":"The Vigilant Rule of 4E 35","kind":"section","href":"/lore/vigilant-rule-4e35","sub":"The rule written for the newly founded Knights Vigilant.","terms":"Penned for the Newly Founded Knights Vigilant, or, The Vigilants of Stendarr, by First Keeper Maurice of Glenpoint It has been 30 years since we first took our vows; then, we were known as Crusaders, sworn guards of Stendarr’s temple. We knew then, as we say now with vigor, that our oaths would draw us out beyond the narrow scope of defending that holy building. We knew that Stendarr’s Mercy would"},{"label":"The Imperial Legion in Skyrim, 4E 185","kind":"section","href":"/lore/imperial-legion-4e185","sub":"An account of Imperial order and dominance, dated to the present year.","terms":"An Account of Order, Duty, and Dominion in a Divided Land In these years after the Great War, amidst the cold winds and brittle loyalties of Skyrim, the Imperial Legion stands as both shield and symbol of the Empire’s enduring authority. Our presence in the province today is not purely that of a military force, but as a stabilizing power striving to preserve unity in a land threatened by the Aldme"},{"label":"Criminal Underworld in Skyrim","kind":"section","href":"/lore/penitus-skyrim-report","sub":"A report on criminal enterprises, compiled for the Emperor.","terms":"Report compiled for the Emperor Director Mattius Locundus, Headmaster of the Imperial Order of the Penitus Occulatus, Personal secretary to the Emperor"},{"label":"Fling","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Fling","sub":"Alteration, 53 magicka","terms":"Fling"},{"label":"Waterbreathing","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Waterbreathing","sub":"Alteration, 68 magicka","terms":"Waterbreathing"},{"label":"Candlelight","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Candlelight","sub":"Alteration, 71 magicka","terms":"Candlelight"},{"label":"Open Novice Lock","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Open%20Novice%20Lock","sub":"Alteration, 71 magicka","terms":"Open Lock"},{"label":"Oakflesh","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Oakflesh","sub":"Alteration, 103 magicka","terms":"Fortify Armor Rating Armor 30 Perk bonus Armor 50 Perk bonus"},{"label":"Teleport Mystic Refuge","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Teleport%20Mystic%20Refuge","sub":"Alteration, 12 magicka","terms":"Mystic Refuge Spell Effect"},{"label":"Detect Life","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Detect%20Life","sub":"Alteration, 32 magicka","terms":"Detect Life Friend Interior Detect Life Friend Exterior Detect Life Enemy Exterior"},{"label":"Super Magelight","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Super%20Magelight","sub":"Alteration, 72 magicka","terms":"big light thing"},{"label":"Magelight","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Magelight","sub":"Alteration, 83 magicka","terms":"Magelight"},{"label":"Dispel","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Dispel","sub":"Alteration, 103 magicka","terms":"Dispel"},{"label":"Open Apprentice Lock","kind":"spell","href":"/magic#spells&q=Open%20Apprentice%20Lock","sub":"Alteration, 152 magicka","terms":"Open Lock"},{"label":"