vy Armor Bear Pelt Fox Pelt"},{"label":"My One-Handed is Adept, I need two more tiers.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I can hold my own with a blade. I have never had proper training with one.","terms":"My One-Handed is Adept, I need two more tiers. I can hold my own with a blade. I have never had proper training with one. "},{"label":"I put eight points into Destruction.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I studied under a mage in Whiterun for two winters. Fire, mostly.","terms":"I put eight points into Destruction. I studied under a mage in Whiterun for two winters. Fire, mostly. Magic on Mereth needs a teacher and a book, so who taught you is a real part of your character, not a number."},{"label":"I'm only level 12, I can't fight him.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I have seen what that man does to people. I am not walking into it.","terms":"I'm only level 12, I can't fight him. I have seen what that man does to people. I am not walking into it. "},{"label":"I need to grind smithing.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I am looking for work at a forge. I will sweep the floor if it means watching him work.","terms":"I need to grind smithing. I am looking for work at a forge. I will sweep the floor if it means watching him work. "},{"label":"That's locked behind Master tier.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I have not been taught that. I would need to find someone who has.","terms":"That's locked behind Master tier. I have not been taught that. I would need to find someone who has. "},{"label":"My build is a stealth archer.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I hunt. I am better at it from a distance, and better still if nobody knows I am there.","terms":"My build is a stealth archer. I hunt. I am better at it from a distance, and better still if nobody knows I am there. "},{"label":"I'm out of energy.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#sheet","sub":"Say instead: I am spent. I have been on my feet since first light.","terms":"I'm out of energy. I am spent. I have been on my feet since first light. "},{"label":"I died and respawned at the temple.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: I woke on a cot in the temple. Somebody carried me there, and I do not know who.","terms":"I died and respawned at the temple. I woke on a cot in the temple. Somebody carried me there, and I do not know who. How you came back is a scene. Take it, it is free."},{"label":"Server's lagging.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: Say nothing in the scene. Step out first.","terms":"Server's lagging. Say nothing in the scene. Step out first. "},{"label":"I have to log off, my dinner's ready.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: I am for bed. Ride safe.","terms":"I have to log off, my dinner's ready. I am for bed. Ride safe. Put your character somewhere a person would plausibly be before you go, rather than vanishing mid-street."},{"label":"Anyone know where the quest marker is?","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: Has anyone heard where the work is? I am asking after a job.","terms":"Anyone know where the quest marker is? Has anyone heard where the work is? I am asking after a job. "},{"label":"Just an NPC.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: The innkeeper. The smith. That woman by the gate.","terms":"Just an NPC. The innkeeper. The smith. That woman by the gate. "},{"label":"Is this scripted?","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: Nothing. If you truly need to know, that is a Discord question.","terms":"Is this scripted? Nothing. If you truly need to know, that is a Discord question. "},{"label":"Brb, AFK.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#machine","sub":"Say instead: Sit your character down somewhere sensible and say nothing.","terms":"Brb, AFK. Sit your character down somewhere sensible and say nothing. "},{"label":"I'm gonna make a new character to join the Legion.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#meta","sub":"Say instead: Have this one ask. Walk into the barracks and ask a legionnaire how a man enlists.","terms":"I'm gonna make a new character to join the Legion. Have this one ask. Walk into the barracks and ask a legionnaire how a man enlists. Almost every faction on Mereth takes people in character. Announcing a second character in a scene tells everyone present that the person in front of them is disposable, and it is the fastest way to flatten a room."},{"label":"My other character knows this guy.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#meta","sub":"Say instead: This character has never met him. Play that.","terms":"My other character knows this guy. This character has never met him. Play that. What one of your characters knows, another one does not. Acting on it is metagaming, and it is unfair in a way that is hard to prove and easy to feel."},{"label":"Somebody told me in Discord he's a vampire.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#meta","sub":"Say instead: Your character has heard nothing. Until they see it or someone tells them in a scene, they do not know.","terms":"Somebody told me in Discord he's a vampire. Your character has heard nothing. Until they see it or someone tells them in a scene, they do not know. "},{"label":"I'm going to retire this character.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#meta","sub":"Say instead: That is a real decision, and it is made out of character. Do not announce it in a scene. Give them an exit somebody could believe.","terms":"I'm going to retire this character. That is a real decision, and it is made out of character. Do not announce it in a scene. Give them an exit somebody could believe. "},{"label":"Who are you actually?","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#meta","sub":"Say instead: Do not ask. Your character has a name to go on, and that is all they get.","terms":"Who are you actually? Do not ask. Your character has a name to go on, and that is all they get. Your Discord name already matches your character name, per CRE.3, so there is nothing left to ask."},{"label":"Bruh. No cap. YOLO.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: By the Nine. Talos preserve us. Gods be good.","terms":"Bruh. No cap. YOLO. By the Nine. Talos preserve us. Gods be good. N.3 names these three specifically."},{"label":"lol / lmao","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: Laugh. Or write it: he snorts into his cup.","terms":"lol / lmao Laugh. Or write it: he snorts into his cup. "},{"label":"OK. Yeah, cool.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: Aye. As you say. Fair enough.","terms":"OK. Yeah, cool. Aye. As you say. Fair enough. "},{"label":"Hey guys.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: Well met. Evening. Gods bless.","terms":"Hey guys. Well met. Evening. Gods bless. "},{"label":"Dude. Man. Buddy.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: Friend. Kinsman. Stranger. Milk-drinker, if you mean it.","terms":"Dude. Man. Buddy. Friend. Kinsman. Stranger. Milk-drinker, if you mean it. "},{"label":"Thanks so much!","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: You have my thanks. I will not forget it.","terms":"Thanks so much! You have my thanks. I will not forget it. "},{"label":"Sorry, my bad.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: My mistake. I spoke out of turn.","terms":"Sorry, my bad. My mistake. I spoke out of turn. "},{"label":"Guys, wait up.","kind":"phrase","href":"/language#mouth","sub":"Say instead: Hold. A moment, all of you.","terms":"Guys, wait up. Hold. A moment, all of you. "},{"label":"S.1 Staff hold the right to change any and all rules and regulations at an...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#summary","sub":"The short version","terms":"Staff hold the right to change any and all rules and regulations at any time."},{"label":"S.2 Mereth RP is an 18+ community.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#summary","sub":"The short version","terms":"Mereth RP is an 18+ community."},{"label":"S.3 Staff hold the right to take disciplinary action against any member of...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#summary","sub":"The short version","terms":"Staff hold the right to take disciplinary action against any member of the community for any infraction outlined in these rules."},{"label":"S.4 Voice changers and modulators are allowed, but must maintain a realist...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#summary","sub":"The short version","terms":"Voice changers and modulators are allowed, but must maintain a realistic pitch. Not too low, not too high."},{"label":"CRE.1 Names and appearance must be lore-appropriate for Skyrim in the Fourth...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#character","sub":"Your character","terms":"Names and appearance must be lore-appropriate for Skyrim in the Fourth Era, and should fit your race's naming conventions. If your character was raised by another culture and their name reflects that, explain it in your whitelist backstory."},{"label":"CRE.2 No historical figures, legendary figures, celebrities, characters from...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#character","sub":"Your character","terms":"No historical figures, legendary figures, celebrities, characters from another IP, or joke names. Ulfric Stormcloak, the Dragonborn, Tiber Septim, Sheogorath, Jon Snow, Geralt of Rivia and Ben Dover are all out."},{"label":"CRE.3 Your Discord name must match your character's name.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#character","sub":"Your character","terms":"Your Discord name must match your character's name."},{"label":"CRE.4 Your character must be 18 or older.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#character","sub":"Your character","terms":"Your character must be 18 or older."},{"label":"SRP.1 Keep it professional. We are all here for a good time, but maintain a ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#serious","sub":"Serious roleplay","terms":"Keep it professional. We are all here for a good time, but maintain a level of seriousness appropriate for immersive roleplay."},{"label":"SRP.2 Everything your character does should be considered as if it were thei...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#serious","sub":"Serious roleplay","terms":"Everything your character does should be considered as if it were their real life. Think about consequences and how your actions affect your character's future in Skyrim."},{"label":"SRP.3 No AI writing, in any form. Certain roles, factions and whitelist appl...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#serious","sub":"Serious roleplay","terms":"No AI writing, in any form. Certain roles, factions and whitelist applications require original backstories written by you."},{"label":"B.1 Out-of-character talk in character is prohibited. If an issue arises, ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#serious","sub":"Serious roleplay","terms":"Out-of-character talk in character is prohibited. If an issue arises, remove yourself from the scene quickly but methodically and handle it in a ticket or a direct message."},{"label":"B.2 A ticket is out of character. Do not discuss one in character.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#serious","sub":"Serious roleplay","terms":"A ticket is out of character. Do not discuss one in character."},{"label":"N.1 Failing to roleplay injuries, refusing reasonable in-character request...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#intent","sub":"Intent to roleplay","terms":"Failing to roleplay injuries, refusing reasonable in-character requests from guards or authority, or using mechanics to escape restraint without roleplay. That last one is also powergaming."},{"label":"N.2 Obvious attempts at trolling or griefing.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#intent","sub":"Intent to roleplay","terms":"Obvious attempts at trolling or griefing."},{"label":"N.3 Modern slang breaks the Fourth Era. Bruh, cap and YOLO are not permitt...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#intent","sub":"Intent to roleplay","terms":"Modern slang breaks the Fourth Era. Bruh, cap and YOLO are not permitted."},{"label":"N.4 Use in-universe expressions instead. By the Nine. Talos preserve us. M...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#intent","sub":"Intent to roleplay","terms":"Use in-universe expressions instead. By the Nine. Talos preserve us. Milk-drinker. S'wit, N'wah, fetcher. By Y'ffre. May your road lead to warm sands. Walk with the shadows."},{"label":"NVL.1 Value your character's life at all times. Roleplay over ruleplay. If s...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#life","sub":"Valuing your life","terms":"Value your character's life at all times. Roleplay over ruleplay. If someone has a blade to your throat or a spell aimed at you, consider your options carefully, and fight realistically using cover."},{"label":"NVL.2 Outnumbered five to one or worse and you retaliate, that is not valuin...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#life","sub":"Valuing your life","terms":"Outnumbered five to one or worse and you retaliate, that is not valuing life. This includes against guards. The aggressors must have weapons drawn or spells readied and aimed for it to apply."},{"label":"NVL.3 If you hear combat, do not run toward it unless you are directly invol...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#life","sub":"Valuing your life","terms":"If you hear combat, do not run toward it unless you are directly involved or are responding as a guard or authority figure."},{"label":"T.1 No language that is homophobic or mocks any real-world culture, ethnic...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"No language that is homophobic or mocks any real-world culture, ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation or political belief. This includes hate speech and iconography."},{"label":"T.2 No excessive toxicity, slurs, or telling people to kill themselves.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"No excessive toxicity, slurs, or telling people to kill themselves."},{"label":"T.3 No toxicity or harassment in Discord, on stream, or in direct messages...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"No toxicity or harassment in Discord, on stream, or in direct messages."},{"label":"T.4 In-universe prejudice rooted in Elder Scrolls lore is permitted: Nordi...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"In-universe prejudice rooted in Elder Scrolls lore is permitted: Nordic distrust of elves, Dunmer views on outsiders, and so on. It must stay strictly in character, and must never be a cover for real-world bigotry or used to make another player genuinely uncomfortable."},{"label":"T.5 Smack talk is allowed, with a line. Players may give their characters ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"Smack talk is allowed, with a line. Players may give their characters handicaps such as missing limbs, chronic illness or speech impediments. These may be referenced in character until the player says it should go no further. Continuing after that is toxicity."},{"label":"ERP.1 No erotic roleplay, in public view or private. Romance is allowed; if ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"No erotic roleplay, in public view or private. Romance is allowed; if it progresses to an adult level, fade to black or take it to direct messages."},{"label":"ERP.2 Non-consensual erotic roleplay, including sexual assault and harassmen...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#conduct","sub":"Conduct toward other people","terms":"Non-consensual erotic roleplay, including sexual assault and harassment, and degrading acts on downed or incapacitated players, is a permanent and irreversible ban."},{"label":"PPI.1 You may only attack the person or people you initiated with.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"You may only attack the person or people you initiated with."},{"label":"PPI.2 Your group may join in if they were present for the initiation.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"Your group may join in if they were present for the initiation."},{"label":"PPI.3 Archers, mages and any ranged support must be announced before acting....","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"Archers, mages and any ranged support must be announced before acting. You need not give a precise location: \"I've got eyes on you from a distance\" is enough."},{"label":"PPI.4 No restraining or attacking without proper initiation first.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"No restraining or attacking without proper initiation first."},{"label":"PPI.5 Initiation must be long enough for the victim to exit any menu or anim...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"Initiation must be long enough for the victim to exit any menu or animation, and they must comply before you can restrain or attack. Staying in a menu to avoid roleplay is itself against the rules."},{"label":"PPI.6 Initiation must be clear and direct. \"If I see you again, you're dead\"...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"Initiation must be clear and direct. \"If I see you again, you're dead\" is not initiation."},{"label":"PPI.7 Leave a scene and you have ten minutes to return and act before you mu...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"Leave a scene and you have ten minutes to return and act before you must initiate again."},{"label":"PPI.8 A quickdraw must be with a one-handed weapon or a readied spell. Pulli...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#initiation","sub":"Initiating on another player","terms":"A quickdraw must be with a one-handed weapon or a readied spell. Pulling a two-hander off your back and swinging immediately is powergaming."},{"label":"1.1 No pocket wiping. You may take one equipped weapon, three inventory it...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"No pocket wiping. You may take one equipped weapon, three inventory items (stackables count as one), and all carried gold. Nothing else."},{"label":"1.2 Robbing as a group, only one person takes items from the victim.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"Robbing as a group, only one person takes items from the victim."},{"label":"1.4 Do not harm victims after the robbery is complete, unless they are a g...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"Do not harm victims after the robbery is complete, unless they are a genuine threat to your freedom or life."},{"label":"1.5 You may not rob someone you have just healed or revived, and you may n...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"You may not rob someone you have just healed or revived, and you may not camp a downed player waiting to rob them."},{"label":"1.6 Sixty minutes real time between player-to-player robberies. No chain r...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"Sixty minutes real time between player-to-player robberies. No chain robbing."},{"label":"1.7 You may not rob the same person twice within 24 hours.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"You may not rob the same person twice within 24 hours."},{"label":"1.8 No changing clothes or appearance for 30 minutes after a robbery.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"No changing clothes or appearance for 30 minutes after a robbery."},{"label":"1.9 You may not force anyone to withdraw items or gold from storage, a ban...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"You may not force anyone to withdraw items or gold from storage, a bank or any safe location."},{"label":"2.2 Storage theft is capped at three items and 500 gold, and you may never...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"Storage theft is capped at three items and 500 gold, and you may never empty a container. Leave something behind."},{"label":"2.4 One hour real time before you may steal from storage again, and never ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"One hour real time before you may steal from storage again, and never the same player or faction twice within 48 hours."},{"label":"2.6 Breaking in must be roleplayed. Running in and looting is powergaming.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#robbery","sub":"Robbery and theft","terms":"Breaking in must be roleplayed. Running in and looting is powergaming."},{"label":"3.1 Torture roleplay requires consent, and consent for each individual act...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#torture","sub":"Torture and duelling","terms":"Torture roleplay requires consent, and consent for each individual action. Ask with /do, receive with /me, act only on a yes."},{"label":"3.2 If consent is denied, no torture takes place. If a player's response a...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#torture","sub":"Torture and duelling","terms":"If consent is denied, no torture takes place. If a player's response avoids a specific act, you may not retry that act."},{"label":"3.3 Never remove heads or limbs without consent. This can be a ban for tox...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#torture","sub":"Torture and duelling","terms":"Never remove heads or limbs without consent. This can be a ban for toxicity."},{"label":"4.1 Duelling is permitted. Both parties must agree, and the loser must und...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#torture","sub":"Torture and duelling","terms":"Duelling is permitted. Both parties must agree, and the loser must understand their character will be permanently killed. Losing and refusing to perma-kill draws disciplinary action."},{"label":"4.2 A sanctioned duel has guards or an authority present as witness and it...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#torture","sub":"Torture and duelling","terms":"A sanctioned duel has guards or an authority present as witness and its outcome is lawful. An unsanctioned duel may see the winner face criminal charges in character."},{"label":"P.1 Downed and treated by an NPC healer, you only vaguely remember what le...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Downed and treated by an NPC healer, you only vaguely remember what led to it. Treated by a player healer, you remember everything."},{"label":"P.2 While a player healer treats you, you are in their custody until disch...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"While a player healer treats you, you are in their custody until discharged. Guards can enforce this."},{"label":"P.3 Downed and healed, you cannot rejoin the scene.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Downed and healed, you cannot rejoin the scene."},{"label":"P.4 No respawning while in the custody of another player, a guard or a hea...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"No respawning while in the custody of another player, a guard or a healer."},{"label":"P.5 You may not use an NPC healer when a player healer is present and avai...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"You may not use an NPC healer when a player healer is present and available."},{"label":"P.6 You may not respawn to avoid roleplay.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"You may not respawn to avoid roleplay."},{"label":"P.7 You may roleplay a terminal illness, but you must be prepared to perma...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"You may roleplay a terminal illness, but you must be prepared to perma-kill from it based on the healer's examination, must roleplay with player medical staff, and may not infect other players."},{"label":"P.8 Seeing Sovngarde costs you the thirty minutes before your death.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Seeing Sovngarde costs you the thirty minutes before your death."},{"label":"PD.1 A perma-killed character is gone for good, and requires a ticket so st...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"A perma-killed character is gone for good, and requires a ticket so staff can delete it."},{"label":"PD.2 A will must be filed by ticket at least two days before the perma-kill...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"A will must be filed by ticket at least two days before the perma-kill for it to be valid."},{"label":"PD.3 A will may pass items, weapons and gold to another player. It may neve...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"A will may pass items, weapons and gold to another player. It may never pass anything to another character of your own, and your next character cannot inherit a home or gold."},{"label":"PD.4 Perma-kill while owning a business or home and you must appoint a new ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Perma-kill while owning a business or home and you must appoint a new owner in the will. Unappointed property returns to the hold."},{"label":"PD.5 Your next character may rejoin the same whitelisted faction or job, bu...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Your next character may rejoin the same whitelisted faction or job, but starts at the lowest position and waits 15 days."},{"label":"PD.6 You cannot join a criminal organisation for two weeks after a perma-ki...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"You cannot join a criminal organisation for two weeks after a perma-kill."},{"label":"PD.7 Serious crimes may end your character. Staff try to be fair and offer ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Serious crimes may end your character. Staff try to be fair and offer a choice where they can: life imprisonment, banishment from the hold, or execution."},{"label":"PD.8 Jarls may execute the leader of a bandit faction once criteria set and...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#death","sub":"Death, injury and perma-kills","terms":"Jarls may execute the leader of a bandit faction once criteria set and communicated by staff have been met."},{"label":"DB.2 A contract must be submitted by ticket to the Head Government and appr...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#brotherhood","sub":"The Dark Brotherhood","terms":"A contract must be submitted by ticket to the Head Government and approved before any attempt. It requires valid in-character justification with clips; an out-of-character grudge is never valid. The target must have committed significant offences or have a compelling narrative reason: betrayal, witnessed crimes, broken oaths."},{"label":"DB.3 The requester performs the Black Sacrament and submits a ticket with t...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#brotherhood","sub":"The Dark Brotherhood","terms":"The requester performs the Black Sacrament and submits a ticket with the reasoning and a picture of the sacrament. Staff review whether it is valid and narratively compelling. The target is never told out of character that a contract exists."},{"label":"DB.4 The assassin must initiate proper roleplay before any attempt. A silen...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#brotherhood","sub":"The Dark Brotherhood","terms":"The assassin must initiate proper roleplay before any attempt. A silent execution is permitted only against a target caught completely unaware and alone. If the target escapes or wins, the contract has failed and the assassin perma-kills if caught and killed. A failed contract cannot be retried for 14 days."},{"label":"DB.5 No more than two approved contracts server-wide at once. No player may...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#brotherhood","sub":"The Dark Brotherhood","terms":"No more than two approved contracts server-wide at once. No player may be targeted more than once in 30 days. Contracts on jarls, guards or essential figures need explicit Head Government approval and a significant lore reason."},{"label":"DB.6 A successful contract means the victim perma-kills. The Brotherhood do...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#brotherhood","sub":"The Dark Brotherhood","terms":"A successful contract means the victim perma-kills. The Brotherhood does not boast publicly. Both parties stay respectful out of character, and clips go to staff for verification."},{"label":"DB.7 Abusing the contract system for grudges, harassment or repeat targetin...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#brotherhood","sub":"The Dark Brotherhood","terms":"Abusing the contract system for grudges, harassment or repeat targeting means removal from the faction and a possible server ban."},{"label":"B.1 One business per player, across all of your characters.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#work","sub":"Businesses and jobs","terms":"One business per player, across all of your characters."},{"label":"B.2 Two jobs per player. A guard captain may permit a second job, but you ...","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#work","sub":"Businesses and jobs","terms":"Two jobs per player. A guard captain may permit a second job, but you cannot be on duty while working it, and you may only report crime rather than react to it."},{"label":"B.3 Businesses are limited to ten employees, not counting the owner.","kind":"rule","href":"/rules#work","sub":"Businesses and jobs","terms":"Businesses are limited to ten employees, not counting the owner."},{"la